OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly rain soon clearing. Then
OL,6,Fwindy, with a mixture of sunny spells
OL,7,Fand variable amounts of cloud. While
OL,8,Fthe odd shower cannot be ruled out,
OL,9,Fmost places will be dry. Temperatures
OL,10,Fwill be a little above normal for late
OL,11,FOctober.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers easing through the
OL,14,Fevening, with clear spells developing.
OL,15,FWinds also easing a little. Some
OL,16,Fthicker cloud, and perhaps some rain,
OL,17,Fmoving into the Derbyshire hills by
OL,18,Fdawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
