OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA few outbreaks of rain at
OL,6,Ffirst, however these soon fading
OL,7,Fthrough the morning with most places
OL,8,Fdry. Bright or sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping, with winds also easing
OL,10,Ffurther. Rather mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FSettled with variable cloud and sunny
OL,14,Fspells, and temperatures near normal.
OL,15,FOvernight mist and fog patches are
OL,16,Flikely and could be slow to clear.
OL,17,FWinds becoming light and variable.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
